# Raw network survey export. The project owner's November 2026 publication
# decision makes names, work e-mails, expertise and skills of both populations
# public, so the two analysis workbooks are committed as the source of truth.
# This file is not one of them: it is the raw export, carrying every verbatim
# free-text answer, and it is only an input for the e-mail join. Place it in
# data/ locally to run scripts/generate_network_data.py; without it the script
# falls back to data/network_emails.json, which holds the addresses already
# extracted from it.
data/Knowledge_Mapping_Survey_GCDC_Network.xlsx

# Derived engagement plan: who to approach first, and with what validation
# action. The publication decision covers expertise and contact details, not
# the Center's own approach priorities for named officials of six foreign
# health authorities. No view reads it, so it also stays out of the bundles.
data/network/engagement.json

